 model from=0A                                                    the offic=
ial website and follow these steps:=0A                                     =
           &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                              =
  &lt;p&gt;a) Select the Start button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                 =
                                   Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a pr=
inter or=0A                                                    scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=
=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to fin=
d nearby printers, then choose the=0A                                      =
